          "x": 113.77777777777777,
          "y": 469.95348837209303,
          "name": "可调正文 2",
          "fill": "#AEBBBD",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1040,
          "content": "ADMIN 名称、编号、摄像头编号与地点标签。身份识别阶段引用同一组数据，避免镜头与档案文字不一致。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Jost",
          "fontSize": 15.627906976744185,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
